# Feature briefs

These are **agent implementation notes**, not user manuals. Index: `docs/features/README.md`.

1. `python -m graphify query "<feature>"`
2. Open `docs/features/<slug>.md` where `<slug>` is the dashboard `data-module-id` (or href id).
3. Radio-optimization wrappers: also read `docs/features/_radio-engine.md`.
4. After a real change: add one dated **History** line; move **Plans** if the next step changed. Bump `core/module_versions.py` only when the UI version label should change.

Do not invent roadmap items. Dated session work still belongs in `progress.md`.
